# kmi-unresolved.baseline — names the 198 reference vendor_dlkm modules import that
# NEITHER our vmlinux NOR the reference set exports: they resolve against modules
# outside the set (vendor_boot: cfg80211, aee/mrdump, ...). lib/kmi_check.py fails
# (exit 4) on any such name NOT listed here = an export our kernel lost.
# Taken from v9 ksunext (booted on the RS4, 2026-10-28); vanilla/kowsu v9 identical.
# Regenerate only from a build that BOOTED, never from the build under test.
